  "name": "Piercing Shot",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The archer may use this talent as a standard action to make a single ranged attack at his full attack bonus with his bow or crossbow. Instead of attacking a specific target, the projectile affects all creatures in a single line, originating from the archer and going out a distance equal to the range increment of the weapon he uses. This attack applies to each target in the line, hitting each target whose AC he beats with his attack roll and dealing normal damage (plus the effects of any special properties on the projectile). If a critical hit is confirmed, the archer critically hits only the first target struck in the line.</p>",
